{
 "name": "Draft length for n-gram drafts on Brain Engine 21: shorter guesses against the 170-330 ms pauses, code edit vs plain chat, 2 rounds",
 "method": "app/docs/test-results/2026-11-16-speed-test-method.md (addendum 68)",
